b/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064449 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186065195 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064449 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186050208 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064449 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064449 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "abc3056c-c606-506b-b00e-5921984cd770" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065195 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065196 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065195 #edb/ref 1061 3529 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065195 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d4e0fa30-ed7c-5ef6-9aaa-10d6ba2f9c05" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065195 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186065338 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065196 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065197 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065196 #edb/ref 1061 3530 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065196 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "57c38b87-4e15-573a-960c-a61055841b16" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065196 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064301 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065197 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065198 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065197 #edb/ref 1061 3532 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065197 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "94008045-7999-599a-b725-36201f5023db" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065197 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064302 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065198 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065199 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065198 #edb/ref 1061 3536 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065198 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "19a0572e-4edb-579e-b72d-fdc1fefe72ca" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065198 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186065339 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065199 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186065200 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065199 #edb/ref 1061 3537 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065199 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d556d6dc-07a0-5db1-b5db-945a6a81b5eb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065199 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064303 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065200 #edb/ref 1061 3539 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065200 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "7aabc08d-413a-5e15-8a0e-170869a0198c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065200 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186064304 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065338 #edb/ref 1064 "The **power rule for exponents** states that a power raised to another power is equal to the product of the two powers:\n\n$$\n\\left(a^m\\right)^n = a^{mn}\n$$\n\nFor example,\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t\\left(5^2\\right)^3 &= \\\n\t\t\t\t5^{2 \\cdot 3} &= \\\n\t\t\t\t5^6.\n\t}\n$$\n\nTo see why the power rule for exponents is true, let's take the above example and work it out again, the long way:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\\left(5^2\\right)^3 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\\underbrace{5^2\\cdot 5^2\\cdot 5^2}_{3\\text{ times}} &= \\[5pt]\n(5 \\cdot 5) \\cdot (5 \\cdot 5) \\cdot (5 \\cdot 5) &= \\[5pt]\n\t\\underbrace{5\\cdot5\\cdot5\\cdot5\\cdot5\\cdot5}_{6\\text{ times}} &= \\[5pt]\n\t5^6\n}\n$$\n\nThe power rule for exponents is just a shortcut for the process above." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065338 #edb/ref 1065 1480 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065338 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "1a2e18f4-6996-52a0-95eb-77abb10d0e77" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065338 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065339 #edb/ref 1064 "Suppose we want to remove the radical term in an expression like $\\sqrt{x^{3}}.$ To do this, we first convert the radical to a fractional exponent:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{x^{3}}= \\left(x^{3}\\right)^{1/2}\n$$\n\nThen, we can apply the power rule and multiply the fractional exponents:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({x}^{3})}^{1/2} & = \\\\ {x}^{(3)\\cdot (1/2)} & = \\\\ {x}^{3/2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\sqrt{x^{3}} = x^{3/2},\n$$\n\nand in general,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[n]{x^m} = x^{m/n}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065339 #edb/ref 1065 1481 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065339 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "40488864-6672-59b7-9ac6-79903856b484" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065339 #edb/ref 1067 "The Power Rule With Fractional Exponents" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
